        <h1>Privacy Policy for Dual Cam</h1>
        <p class="update-date">Last updated: October 27, 2026</p>

        <p>Thank you for choosing <strong>Dual Cam</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This Privacy Policy explains how your information is handled when you use our iOS application.</p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We believe in privacy-first design. Dual Cam is built to process your media locally on your device:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Camera and Microphone Access:</strong> Dual Cam requires access to your device's cameras and microphone strictly to enable simultaneous recording, photo capturing, and multi-orientation video creation for social media.</li>
            <li><strong>Photos and Storage Access:</strong> The app requests access to your photo library solely to save the dual-camera photos and videos you explicitly choose to export or save.</li>
            <li><strong>Personal Data:</strong> We do <em>not</em> collect, store, or transmit any personal identification information, user accounts, or cloud analytics back to our servers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Since all photo and video capturing happens locally on your iPhone:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Your media stays on your device unless you manually share it to social media platforms or other apps installed on your phone.</li>
            <li>We do not have access to your recordings, photos, or the content you create.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Third-Party Services and Social Media</h2>
        <p>Dual Cam allows you to capture content optimized for social media networks. If you choose to share your exported videos or photos directly to third-party platforms (such as Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, etc.), those platforms operate under their own independent privacy policies. We encourage you to review them.</p>

        <h2>4. Data Security</h2>
        <p>Because your captured videos and photos remain locally on your iOS device protected by Apple's robust sandboxing and security architecture, your data remains fully under your control.</p>

        <h2>5. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

